              "value": "Funnel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, primal, water)\n\nThe kun inhales violently, sucking in heat and all creatures in the water in a 60-foot cone. Creatures take 10d8 cold damage and must attempt a 33 Fortitude save. The kun can't Funnel again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is pulled 30 feet toward the kun.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is pulled 60 feet toward the kun."
            },
